  "description": "Transported to another dimension and unwillingly chosen to become an empire’s Saintess, Yooan Kang quickly realizes being a Saintess is a lot more like being an assistant--only instead of a boss she has Huey, a cute grouchy 99-year-old dragon-man to look after. However, forces are lurking in the shadows to keep Huey tethered to the empire. Will her love be enough to turn the key of Huey’s embittered heart and free him from his isolation?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
